    "raw": "I awoke to find myself surrounded by hooded figures, chanting and squawking. One of them, who appeared to be the figurehead, held a large knife above me. At first I was disoriented, and thought I was back with the Florans. But no. It seems I'd accidentally presented myself for sacrifice. So silly!",
    "value": "我醒来时，发现自己被一群戴着兜帽的身影围住，他们吟唱着，发出尖利的叫声。其中一个看似头领的人，正举着一把大刀悬在我上方。起初我有些迷糊，还以为自己又落入了叶族人手中。但并非如此。看来我是不小心把自己送上门当了祭品。真是太蠢了！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "Of course, I wasn't up for this! Quick as a flash, I kicked the head priest in the face and made my escape, charging through the temple like a Hylotl possessed. There were a few casualties along the way, of course - some sacred urns, a statue or two, an Avian monk - but I escaped intact, and carried on my way.",
    "value": "我当然不乐意这样！说时迟那时快，我飞起一脚踹在主祭司脸上，旋即脱身，如同鲛游般冲过庙宇。沿途自然免不了一些“伤亡” - 几只圣瓮、一两尊雕像，还有一位翼族修道士 - 但我总算毫发无伤地逃脱，继续我的旅程。"
